{
  "schema": 1,
  "name": "Stormbringer: the Power Sphere moves to the target and explodes on it (#12926)",
  "contract": [
    "#12926: Spheres of Power 706434 reads 'Your direct damage dealt now has a 25% chance to summon a Power",
    "Sphere that will move towards your target.' The Power Sphere 503201 is passive and never attacks, but its AI",
    "moved it with MoveChase, and ChaseMovementGenerator pauses whenever the mover's victim is not the chase",
    "target, so the sphere stayed where it was summoned, at the Stormbringer, and only exploded when the enemy",
    "stood on it. It now follows its target with MoveFollow. Its explosion, Power Sphere 706433, was cast by the",
    "Stormbringer with a 15 yard range, so from 20 yards it failed even once the sphere arrived; the sphere now",
    "casts it itself on the Stormbringer's behalf (original caster), with the Stormbringer's faction. A level 80",
    "Stormbringer stands 20 yards from a Harvest Golem, outside the sphere's 5 yard blast, and casts Shock 804020",
    "40 times. Each landed Shock has a 25% chance (706434 ProcChance) to summon a sphere while none is up, so the",
    "chance that no sphere ever appears is 0.75^40, about 1 in 100,000. At least one Power Sphere 706433",
    "explosion must hit the enemy; a sphere that stays at the caster never reaches it. The enemy fixture is",
    "stationary and its distance is asserted again at the end, so the explosion cannot come from the enemy",
    "walking up to a sphere that stayed with the caster."
  ],
  "timeout_ms": 240000,
  "players": [
    {
      "id": "sb",
      "race": 8,
      "class": 16,
      "level": 80,
      "spell_hit_rating": 10000
    }
